<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Negara's reserves rise to 68.54 bln rgt.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara's reserves rise to 68.54 bln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara's gold, foreign exchange and other reserves increased to 68.54 billion ringgit as at October 31, 1996 compared with 68.52 billion a fortnight earlier, the Bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The central bank said its total assets and liabilities rose to 96.28 billion ringgit from 95.56 billion two weeks earlier.</p>
<p> (In bln rgt)   Oct 31, 1996     Oct 15,1996   Oct 31, 1995</p>
<p> Reserves	    68.54		68.52	    63.95</p>
<p> Assets		96.28		95.56	    89.53</p>
<p> Currency	    19.84		19.82	    18.07</p>
<p> Govt paper	   3.09		 3.00	     2.00</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
